   2:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   ******************************************************************************
   3:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   * @file    stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c
   4:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   * @author  MCD Application Team
   5:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   * @brief   JPEG HAL module driver.
   6:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following
   7:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   *          functionalities of the JPEG encoder/decoder peripheral:
   8:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   *           + Initialization and de-initialization functions
   9:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   *           + JPEG processing functions encoding and decoding
  10:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   *           + JPEG decoding Getting Info and encoding configuration setting
  11:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   *           + JPEG enable/disable header parsing functions (for decoding)
  12:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   *           + JPEG Input/Output Buffer configuration.
  13:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   *           + JPEG callback functions
  14:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   *           + JPEG Abort/Pause/Resume functions
  15:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   *           + JPEG custom quantization tables setting functions
  16:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   *           + IRQ handler management
  17:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   *           + Peripheral State and Error functions
  18:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   *
