 203:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   Callbacks can be registered/unregistered in HAL_JPEG_STATE_READY state only.
 204:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   Exception done MspInit/MspDeInit callbacks that can be registered/unregistered
 205:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   in HAL_JPEG_STATE_READY or HAL_JPEG_STATE_RESET state,
 206:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   thus registered (user) MspInit/DeInit callbacks can be used during the Init/DeInit.
 207:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   In that case first register the MspInit/MspDeInit user callbacks
 208:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   using HAL_JPEG_RegisterCallback() before calling HAL_JPEG_DeInit()
 209:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   or HAL_JPEG_Init() function.
 210:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c **** 
 211:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   When The compilation define USE_HAL_JPEG_REGISTER_CALLBACKS is set to 0 or
 212:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   not defined, the callback registration feature is not available and all callbacks
 213:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_jpeg.c ****   are set to the corresponding weak functions.
